/**
\fn pdg::Animated::removeAnimationHelper(IAnimationHelper helper)
\brief Retire a specific animation helper.

An absent helper is ignored. Other owners' registrations are unaffected. A retained helper may be registered again.
Safe inside a callback: removed helpers do not run again on this step, and the
currently executing callback remains alive until it returns.

\param helper Helper to remove from this owner.
\return The original owner object, for chaining.
\see addAnimationHelper()
*/
